# A TEST MODEL FOR THE MODAL RECORDER

node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
node 3 2 0

material Elastic1D 1 1 0

element Spring01 1 1 2 1
element Spring01 2 2 3 1

mass 3 2 1 1
mass 4 3 1 1

fix 1 E 1
fix 2 U2 1 2 3

recorder 1 hdf5 Modal U1 U2 U3 UR1 UR2 UR3
recorder 2 hdf5 ModalForce

step frequency 1 2
set band_mat 0

analyze

# Eigenvalues:
# 0.3820
# 2.6180
# Frequencies (Hz):
# 0.0984
# 0.2575
# Modal participation factors in the U1 direction:
# 1.3764
# 0.3249
# Effective modal masses in the U1 direction:
# 1.8944
# 0.1056
# The N datasets in the Nodes groups of the ModalForce recorder contain the
# nodal modal elastic force K * phi and the E datasets in the Elements groups
# contain the element forces. The value at node 1 is the base reaction.
peek eigenvalue

peek recorder 1
peek recorder 2

save recorder 1
save recorder 2

exit
